ርሸ፥","poem":1},{"text":"“ኑ አንጆ ኡባይ ፅዮነፐ ፑልቴስ” ያጋና።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}